sistent facial features, and realistic fabric weight.\n\noverall_soundscape: A gentle outdoor breeze, faint distant city ambience, and a subtle rustle of silk.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "01｜提示词：主体＋动作＋镜头＋材质＋声音", "mode": 0, "size": [730, 345], "pos": [50, 85], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "bef11fcbfa8d772678e2ad00b1294c63eb3e5da7", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11, "widgets_values_named": {"value": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action luxury fashion film, a single continuous five-second take at normal speed. An exceptionally beautiful r34l1sm,22-year-old Chinese woman stands on a boutique hotel terrace at golden hour. An eye-level waist-up portrait frames her entire head, shoulders, chest, and waist, with a little space above her hair. Her face is large enough for subtle expressions to remain clearly visible.\n\nShe has a refined oval face, expressive almond-shaped dark eyes, elegant cheekbones, a delicate straight nose, and softly defined full lips. Glossy dark hair falls in loose waves over one shoulder. Tasteful makeup, softly defined lashes, and muted rose lipstick complement luminous skin with natural fine texture. Her figure has graceful shoulders, a defined waist, and balanced curves, emphasized by an impeccably tailored ivory silk wrap blouse with a modest V-neck and softly draped sleeves. Small sculptural gold earrings complete the understated styling.\n\nHer body rests at a slight three-quarter angle. During the first two seconds, she gently turns her face toward the camera, her eyes meeting the lens just before her head settles. Over the next two seconds, one corner of her mouth lifts into a subtle, confident smile; her cheeks rise gently and her eyes soften. In the final secon